#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/bug-filing.page:18
msgid "File a bug against Atril"
msgstr "回報 Atril 的臭蟲"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/bug-filing.page:19
msgid ""
"Atril is maintained by a volunteer community. You are welcome to "
"participate. If you notice a problem you can file a <em>bug report</em>. To "
"file a bug, go to <link href=\"https://github.com/mate-desktop/atril/"
"issues\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Atril 由志工社群維護，歡迎您一同參與。如果您發現問題，可以填寫<em>臭蟲回報</"
"em>。若要回報臭蟲，請前往 <link href=\"https://github.com/mate-desktop/atril/"
"issues\"/>。"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/bug-filing.page:22
msgid ""
"This is a bug tracking system where users and developers can file details "
"about bugs, crashes and request enhancements."
msgstr ""
"這是一個臭蟲追蹤系統，使用者與開發人員可以在其中記錄臭蟲與當機的詳細資訊，並"
"提出功能建議。"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/bug-filing.page:25
msgid ""
"To participate you need an account which will give you the ability to gain "
"access, file bugs, and make comments. Also, you need to register so you can "
"receive updates by e-mail about the status of your bug. If you don't already "
"have an account, just click on the <gui>Sign in / Register</gui> link to "
"create one."
msgstr ""
"若要參與，您需要一個帳號，才能存取系統、回報臭蟲與發表評論。此外，您還需要註"
"冊，才能透過電子郵件收到臭蟲狀態的更新。如果您還沒有帳號，只要按一下 <gui>登"
"入／註冊</gui> 連結建立一個即可。"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/bug-filing.page:28
msgid "Once you have an account, log in, and click on <gui>New issue</gui>."
msgstr "有了帳號之後，請登入並按一下 <gui>New issue</gui>。"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/bug-filing.page:31
msgid ""
"Fill in the Title and Description sections and click <gui>Submit Issue</gui>."
msgstr "填寫 Title 與 Description 欄位，然後按一下 <gui>Submit Issue</gui>。"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/bug-filing.page:34
msgid ""
"Your report will be given an ID number, and its status will be updated as it "
